{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52192","headline":"颂六十二首 十七 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业理信多绪，生途非一门。\n安危诚易辙，清浊岂同源。\n坠质空遗貌，寻香有去魂。\n幽衢下寮落，暠路上飞翻。\n凝阴凄复紧，声威聒已喧。\n投身庇茅屋，怿虑入花园。\n伉俪情多乱，贪嗔坐自昏。\n遍知称自觉，挑手独爲尊。\n（见同书同卷《四生部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}